    {
      "id": "s12",
      "type": "CODE_RUN",
      "transition": "push",
      "background": "zoneB",
      "narration": "And the fix is something you already know how to do. Remember episode sixteen, setting your world up over the API? That's this. Each test creates the profile it needs, in forty milliseconds, and then edits that one. No shared state, no assumed order, and it doesn't matter which worker picks it up or when.",
      "data": {
        "codeRun": {
          "filename": "test_profile.py",
          "language": "py",
          "resultLabel": "safe in parallel",
          "color": "green",
          "atWord": 2.667,
          "caption": "each test builds its own world",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "def test_edit_profile(page, api):"
            },
            {
              "text": "    # build MY OWN profile first",
              "detail": "no waiting on another test",
              "sub": "this is the whole fix",
              "label": "own",
              "atWord": 11.75
            },
            {
              "text": "    resp = api.post(\"/api/profiles\","
            },
            {
              "text": "        data={\"name\": \"Ada\"})",
              "detail": "forty milliseconds, by API",
              "sub": "episode sixteen, remember",
              "label": "seed",
              "atWord": 21.583
            },
            {
              "text": "    pid = resp.json()[\"id\"]"
            },
            {
              "text": ""
            },
            {
              "text": "    page.goto(f\"/profiles/{pid}/edit\")",
              "detail": "and edit the one I made",
              "sub": "any worker, any order",
              "label": "edit",
              "atWord": 36.5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "durationFrames": 565,
      "audio": "audio/pw-dojo-18-parallel-ci_long_s12.mp3",
      "timingSource": "tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "type": "CHAPTER",
      "transition": "dip",
      "background": "zoneA",
      "narration": "Last bit. Let's hand the whole job over to a robot, so nobody has to remember to run anything.",
      "data": {
        "chapter": {
          "number": "03",
          "title": "The robot",
